&lt;li&gt;Experience developing machine learning models for real-time bidding (RTB), recommendation systems, ranking, pricing, or other large-scale optimization problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and experience working with production-grade machine learning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in machine learning, statistical modeling, experimentation, and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
