&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with deep learning models in large-scale recommendation or advertising systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI development tools (such as Claude Code or Cursor) to accelerate experimentation and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
