&lt;li&gt;Design, train, and deploy machine learning models for bid optimization, price prediction, win-rate prediction, CTR/CVR estimation, calibration, and auction optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full machine learning lifecycle, from research and experimentation through production deployment, A/B testing, monitoring, and continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze large-scale marketplace data to identify modeling opportunities and translate insights into measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Business teams to define and deliver scalable machine learning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the performance, scalability, and reliability of production models serving low-latency, high-throughput traffic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior data scientists and contribute to technical reviews, experimentation best practices, and knowledge sharing across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
